        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b1",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "OK",
        "value": {
          "ok0": "$[if::(contains::(${r0},<feed),1,0)]",
          "ok1": "$[if::(contains::(${r1},<feed),1,0)]",
          "ok2": "$[if::(contains::(${r2},<feed),1,0)]",
          "ok3": "$[if::(contains::(${r3},<feed),1,0)]",
          "ok4": "$[if::(contains::(${r4},<feed),1,0)]",
          "ok5": "$[if::(contains::(${r5},<feed),1,0)]",
          "ok6": "$[if::(contains::(${r6},<feed),1,0)]",
          "ok7": "$[if::(contains::(${r7},<feed),1,0)]"
        }
      },
      "_note": "取到了没有:不存在的代码 / 被限速时 SEC 回的是 HTML,没有 <feed。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "SP",
        "value": {
          "s0": "$[split::(${r0},<entry>)]",
          "s1": "$[split::(${r1},<entry>)]",
          "s2": "$[split::(${r2},<entry>)]",
          "s3": "$[split::(${r3},<entry>)]",
          "s4": "$[split::(${r4},<entry>)]",
          "s5": "$[split::(${r5},<entry>)]",
          "s6": "$[split::(${r6},<entry>)]",
          "s7": "$[split::(${r7},<entry>)]"
        }
      },
      "_note": "每家按 <entry> 切一次成数组(第 0 段是 feed 头);后面按下标取,不再反复切整份原文。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r0",
        "value": ""
      },
      "_note": "原文用完即清(勿删):后面每个节点都要复制整个数据域,留着 8 份十几 KB 的 XML 白搬。"
    },
