    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nOk",
        "value": "$[calc::(${OK.ok0}+${OK.ok1}+${OK.ok2}+${OK.ok3}+${OK.ok4}+${OK.ok5}+${OK.ok6}+${OK.ok7})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nV",
        "value": "$[calc::(if::(gt::(${TK.k0},0),1,0)+if::(gt::(${TK.k1},0),1,0)+if::(gt::(${TK.k2},0),1,0)+if::(gt::(${TK.k3},0),1,0)+if::(gt::(${TK.k4},0),1,0)+if::(gt::(${TK.k5},0),1,0)+if::(gt::(${TK.k6},0),1,0)+if::(gt::(${TK.k7},0),1,0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "alive",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${cnt},0),1,if::(gt::(${nOk},0),1,0))]"
      },
      "_note": "没关注任何公司 = 合法的空(不抛);关注了但**一家都没取到** = 这次没拿到答案(抛)。部分公司失败照常渲其余的。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${alive},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "secfilings_unreachable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "关注了公司却一家都没取到(断网 / 被限速)→ 抛错,平台回落上次成功的数据(G26/§7.2)。"
    },
